== Trivia ==
* Jupiter, as well as {{i|Neptunus}}, was designed for the original ''Antibirth'' mod, but never actually implemented until ''Repentance''.
* Jupiter's effects and pickup quote reference the planet [[Wikipedia:Jupiter|Jupiter]]'s nature as a [[Wikipedia:Gas giant|gas giant]], being composed mainly of hydrogen and helium in gas and liquid form.
* The item's ability to create fart clouds after standing still and poison immunity could be a reference to ''Nuclear Throne'', where the character [[nuclearthrone:Frog|Frog]] has similar abilities.
* {{dlc|nr+}} Jupiter is the only item that gives a half-full heart container on pickup.

